osure, in block 103, the sewage water level adjusting apparatus 100 may determine, based on an increase rate of the amount of sewage, whether or not the introduced sewage amount exceeds the sewage storage threshold of the first intermediate reservoir as three levels"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101014995-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "when the amount of water increases, the water level sensor detects and opens the initial rainwater blocking door to remove the foreign matter from the primary strainer after collecting the rainwater from the primary strainer, filter it once more from the strainer, and then remove the foreign substance in the sedimentation chamber for final precipitation"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101000865-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, when the pressurized water tank reaches the minimum water level, the disk interlocked with the buckle automatically descends to close the flow path of the water cylinder connected to the water supply and drain pipe, thereby blocking the air pressure from leaking to the outside through the water supply and drain pipe"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102400040-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, the water level of the treated water tank is measured in real time, and when the water level is out of a certain range, the gate valve is selectively opened and closed to block the flow path of the overflow pipe, thereby increasing the overflow height of the treatment tank"}]</data>
